== Super Garuda Shield 2025 ==

[[File:Super Garuda Shield 2025 opening ceremony (9277596).jpg|thumb|Multinational military service members and leaders shake hands during the Opening Ceremony of Super Garuda Shield 2025, Jakarta, 25 August 2025.]]
[[File:Super Garuda Shield 25- U S , Dutch, Japanese forces conduct close quarter battle drills (9297043).jpg|thumb|Dutch, Japanese, U.S. and Indonesian forces conduct close quarter battle drills during Super Garuda Shield 2025, Jakarta, 27 August 2025.]]
[[File:Garuda Shield holds it's annual exercise between the Indonesian National Armed Forces and U S Military (9292279).jpg|thumb|Indonesian, Japanese, Australian and U.S. Army Soldiers pose for a photo after a joint strike live fire exercise during Super Garuda Shield 2025 in Baturaja, Indonesia, 3 September 2025.]]
The Opening Ceremony of Super Garuda Shield 2025 commenced on 25 August 2025 at Naval Command and Staff College (''Seskoal''), Cipulir, [[Jakarta]], opened by [[Deputy Commander of the Indonesian National Armed Forces]] General [[Tandyo Budi Revita]], attended by the Commander of the [[United States Indo-Pacific Command]] Admiral [[Samuel Paparo|Samuel J Paparo]], including other military leaders and senior government from the partnering nations.<ref>{{Cite web |last=U.S. Indo-Pacific Command Public Affairs |date=25 August 2025 |title=USINDOPACOM Commander engages leaders in Indonesia, commences Super Garuda Shield 2025 |url=https://www.pacom.mil/Media/NEWS/News-Article-View/Article/4285313/usindopacom-commander-engages-leaders-in-indonesia-commences-super-garuda-shiel/ |website=pacom.mil |language=en-US}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Puspen TNI |date=25 August 2025 |title=TNI Gelar Latihan Gabungan Bersama Super Garuda Shield 2025 |url=https://tni.mil.id/view-258590-tni-gelar-latihan-gabungan-bersama-super-garuda-shield-2025.html |website=tni.mil.id |language=id}}</ref><ref name=":20">{{Cite web |date=26 August 2025 |title=United States and Indonesia Kick Off Multinational Super Garuda Shield 2025 |url=https://id.usembassy.gov/united-states-and-indonesia-kick-off-multinational-super-garuda-shield-2025/ |access-date=21 September 2025 |website=U.S. Embassy & Consulates in Indonesia |language=en-US}}</ref>

Super Garuda Shield 2025, set to take place from 25 August to 3 September 2025, across multiple locations: at the Naval Staff and Command College (''Seskoal'') in Jakarta, the TNI Peacekeeping Mission Center in [[West Java]], the Indonesian Army Combat Training Center (''Puslatpur'') in [[South Sumatra]], and the 9th Marine Combat Training Center (''Puslatmar IX'') in [[Riau Islands]], involving approximately 6,500 military forces from 13 countries, including Indonesia, the United States, Australia, Japan, the UK, with observers from 11 additional nations.<ref name=":20" /><ref>{{Cite web |last=Sephiawardhani |first=Diffa |date=25 August 2025 |title=Indonesia Leads Super Garuda Shield 2025 Multinational Drills |url=https://rri.co.id/en/international/1789847/indonesia-leads-super-garuda-shield-2025-multinational-drills |website=Radio Republik Indonesia {{!}} rri.co.id |language=en}}</ref><ref name=":19">{{Cite web |last=Antara News |date=26 August 2025 |title=Super Garuda Shield 2025 trains 6,500 troops from 13 nations |url=https://en.antaranews.com/news/375581/super-garuda-shield-2025-trains-6500-troops-from-13-nations |website=antaranews.com |language=en}}</ref>

Super Garuda Shield 2025 features maritime and field training events to include engineering civic action program, staff training exercises, cyber exercises, airborne operations, jungle field training exercises, air assault operations, an amphibious exercise, a large field training exercise and combined arms live fire exercises, and a High Mobility Artillery Rocket System (HIMARS) live fire exercise.<ref name=":20" /><ref name=":19" />

